{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15094","headline":"赠龙兴观主吴崇岳 · 周渭","name":"赠龙兴观主吴崇岳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楮爲冠子布爲裳，吞得丹霞寿最长。\n混俗性灵常乐道，出尘风格早休粮。\n枕中经妙谁传与，肘後方新自写将。\n百尺松梢几飞步，鹤栖板上礼虚皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周渭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}